WEBVTT

00:07.650 --> 00:12.070
Les Misérables

00:07.650 --> 00:12.070
A Girl Named Cosette

00:08.610 --> 00:11.610
Beyond the wind

00:12.070 --> 00:15.490
The wind blows

00:12.070 --> 00:15.490
Kaze ga fuki nuketeku

00:15.490 --> 00:22.120
over the daisies blooming over the stone pavement

00:15.490 --> 00:22.120
Ishidatami ni saku hinagiku

00:22.120 --> 00:25.670
I held my knees

00:22.120 --> 00:25.670
Hiza wo tsuite

00:25.670 --> 00:31.130
and gazed at the flowers

00:25.670 --> 00:31.130
Jitto mitsumeteta

00:31.130 --> 00:34.880
Far away, very far away

00:31.130 --> 00:34.880
Tooku haruka tooku

00:34.880 --> 00:41.470
A gentle voice is calling me

00:34.880 --> 00:41.470
Watashi wo yobu yasashii koe

00:41.470 --> 00:45.100
Let's go look for it

00:41.470 --> 00:45.100
Sagashii ni yukou

00:45.100 --> 00:50.860
Even if we wander aimlessly

00:45.100 --> 00:50.860
Attemonai keredo

00:50.860 --> 00:55.650
The rain comes down

00:50.860 --> 00:55.650
Doushaburi no ame

00:55.650 --> 01:00.370
on a lonely morning

00:55.650 --> 01:00.370
Hitoribocchi no asa

01:00.370 --> 01:04.910
But look, beyond the clouds

01:00.370 --> 01:04.910
Demo hora kumo no mukou

01:04.910 --> 01:09.500
the sunlight is peering at us

01:04.910 --> 01:09.500
Hizashi ga nozoiteruyo

01:09.500 --> 01:11.840
Wipe away your tears

01:09.500 --> 01:11.840
Namida fuite

01:11.840 --> 01:14.800
Look forward

01:11.840 --> 01:14.800
Mae wo muite

01:14.800 --> 01:19.100
and summon all of your strength

01:14.800 --> 01:19.100
Ashimoto chikara komete

01:19.100 --> 01:21.430
Let's walk

01:19.100 --> 01:21.430
Aruite yukou

01:21.430 --> 01:23.810
I'm sure we will make it

01:21.430 --> 01:23.810
Kitto yukeru

01:23.810 --> 01:31.190
The road, the road, continues on...

01:23.810 --> 01:31.190
Michi wa michi wa tsuzuku yo...

01:31.190 --> 01:34.240
forever...

01:31.190 --> 01:34.240
Dokomademo

02:01.900 --> 02:03.460
That was my tenth attempt.

02:04.480 --> 02:07.130
But, I have to find a job somehow.

02:32.850 --> 02:34.370
What can I do for you?

02:34.640 --> 02:37.830
Excuse me, but l am looking for work.

02:44.190 --> 02:48.880
Um, I was wondering if you had any live-in positions.

02:49.490 --> 02:52.590
Unfortunately, we're fully staffed.

02:53.280 --> 02:55.260
I am skilled at sewing.

02:55.290 --> 02:57.600
I can clean and do laundry.

02:57.620 --> 02:59.140
I am willing to do anything.

02:59.160 --> 03:01.270
Do you have a letter of reference?

03:02.330 --> 03:03.480
Well...

03:03.750 --> 03:07.820
I cannot employ someone without any references.

03:09.170 --> 03:10.710
I understand.

03:10.720 --> 03:12.030
Sorry to have bothered you.

03:14.890 --> 03:16.080
Just a minute.

03:19.980 --> 03:22.180
Take this bread with you.

03:23.810 --> 03:25.380
No, thank you, I am fine.

03:26.440 --> 03:29.460
Do you have a place to stay tonight?

03:39.960 --> 03:44.600
Do I look so destitute that I have become a charity-case?

04:05.010 --> 04:10.020
Mother's Skirt

04:12.990 --> 04:18.180
Did you hear that Fantine was evicted from
her home because she couldn't pay the rent?

04:18.200 --> 04:20.600
Really? Winter is coming soon.

04:20.910 --> 04:23.770
She hasn't found new work yet?

04:23.790 --> 04:25.350
How sad...

04:26.210 --> 04:32.400
I ran into her recently. She looked terrible.

04:34.890 --> 04:38.780
How miserable she must be.

04:48.360 --> 04:51.920
Production seems to be increasing.

04:52.990 --> 04:55.220
Have there been any changes?

04:55.240 --> 04:59.930
Yes, I dismissed a troublesome girl.

05:02.290 --> 05:04.640
Everything else is fine.

05:04.660 --> 05:07.900
I see... I trust your judgment.

05:09.710 --> 05:11.320
I'm counting on you.

05:11.960 --> 05:13.280
Thank you.

05:26.440 --> 05:30.540
Cosette has recovered and she is now doing fine.

05:31.270 --> 05:32.380
I'm glad.

05:32.400 --> 05:33.920
You're all better, Cosette.

05:37.950 --> 05:39.220
<i>But,</i>

05:39.240 --> 05:42.510
<i>Cosette is getting bigger and winter is coming soon.</i>

05:42.790 --> 05:45.740
<i>She has no clothes for the Winter.</i>

05:45.750 --> 05:49.230
<i>She is in dire need of a warm skirt.</i>

05:50.000 --> 05:54.320
<i>Letters are fine, but please send us ten francs.</i>

05:54.340 --> 05:57.570
<i>It would be terrible if Cosette were to become ill again.</i>

05:57.590 --> 06:02.160
<i>Please, send us ten francs as soon as possible.</i>

06:05.270 --> 06:06.750
Ten francs...

06:09.690 --> 06:14.170
How am I supposed to make ten francs?

06:16.070 --> 06:18.260
Watch where you're walking!

06:26.540 --> 06:29.640
I've wanted this outfit for a long time.

06:29.670 --> 06:31.100
Thank you, Mother.

06:31.130 --> 06:32.060
I'm so happy!

06:33.920 --> 06:37.860
If only I could give such an outfit to Cosette.

06:44.060 --> 06:45.580
It looks warm.

06:47.100 --> 06:48.410
Ten francs...

06:48.810 --> 06:53.210
I can't find a job, how am I supposed to get money?

06:58.280 --> 06:59.470
With this, I can...

07:00.570 --> 07:04.350
No, this is the one thing I cannot...

07:28.930 --> 07:30.290
Would you like to try one?

07:30.310 --> 07:31.460
No...

07:32.940 --> 07:35.330
Please have a seat.

07:35.360 --> 07:36.170
Yes...

07:47.700 --> 07:49.600
You have beautiful hair.

07:49.620 --> 07:51.600
The length and gloss is just right.

07:51.620 --> 07:53.440
I need money.

07:53.460 --> 07:55.310
As much as possible.

07:55.340 --> 07:57.110
Cut and buy as much as you need.

07:57.130 --> 07:59.860
Well then, how does seven francs sound?

08:00.670 --> 08:02.320
That's not enough!

08:02.340 --> 08:05.070
Please, give me ten francs.

08:06.140 --> 08:07.910
Very well.

08:17.770 --> 08:22.050
Cosette, now you won't be cold.

08:22.070 --> 08:25.010
My hair shall clothe you.

08:29.990 --> 08:32.350
Hey, what's inside?

08:32.370 --> 08:34.940
That's a huge package!

08:38.960 --> 08:41.650
I bet it's full of delicious snacks.

08:41.670 --> 08:44.210
Or maybe a big doll.

08:45.340 --> 08:46.700
What's this?

08:47.720 --> 08:50.080
It's a little girl's skirt.

08:50.100 --> 08:53.910
I get it. It's because of what you wrote in that letter.

08:53.940 --> 08:56.460
You told her that Cosette needed a skirt.

08:57.150 --> 09:00.130
That's why she sent this thing.

09:01.940 --> 09:03.170
Good grief...

09:03.740 --> 09:07.010
You've really done it now.

09:07.030 --> 09:09.720
Mother sent that for me?

09:09.740 --> 09:11.180
Thank you!

09:11.200 --> 09:12.530
Mother!

09:13.000 --> 09:15.390
Try it on, Éponine.

09:15.420 --> 09:17.410
That skirt is for Cosette!

09:17.420 --> 09:19.480
Be quiet, Gavroche!

09:19.500 --> 09:22.820
I don't need such a lame skirt!

09:22.840 --> 09:24.860
In that case, can I have it?

09:26.300 --> 09:28.160
It's just right for me!

09:29.430 --> 09:30.870
Hand it over!

09:30.890 --> 09:32.830
Stop pulling on it, Gavroche!

09:33.220 --> 09:34.870
Cut it out, Gavroche!

09:38.520 --> 09:41.460
She wants to play hardball.

09:41.860 --> 09:47.440
If she's going to stop sending us money, we need
to reconsider our treatment of Cosette.

09:47.450 --> 09:48.930
Good point.

09:55.410 --> 10:00.650
However, she did send this pretty quickly after we requested those ten francs.

10:00.670 --> 10:02.520
Which can only mean that...

10:02.960 --> 10:04.110
What?

10:04.630 --> 10:07.150
It means she has come into money.

10:07.590 --> 10:12.950
If that's the case, we'll be able to milk her for even more.

10:38.960 --> 10:40.140
Good work.

10:40.170 --> 10:41.100
Thank you.

10:46.840 --> 10:48.440
Here, take this.

10:48.470 --> 10:49.780
Thank you for everything.

10:56.560 --> 11:02.460
<i>If you continue to delay your payment, you will
have to leave Cosette in someone else's care.</i>

11:02.480 --> 11:05.670
<i>That is how much of a burden she has become.</i>

11:08.280 --> 11:09.670
Just a bit more...

11:11.530 --> 11:13.930
I will save up five francs...

11:13.950 --> 11:17.180
It's not much, but I will send it to Cosette.

11:35.100 --> 11:37.200
Welcome back, Fantine.

11:37.970 --> 11:39.410
Here you go, ma'am.

11:39.430 --> 11:43.790
It's full today, we'll have a feast.

11:43.810 --> 11:49.760
Fantine, it looks like the flower vendor has been
looking for a worker for the evening shift.

11:49.780 --> 11:50.980
Would you like to go?

11:50.990 --> 11:53.130
Yes, thank you.

11:53.620 --> 11:57.300
Then you should go to the west side of the market at four.

11:57.330 --> 11:59.600
Someone should come for you then.

11:59.620 --> 12:02.140
Yes, thank you for everything.

12:02.170 --> 12:08.770
You're amazing. You're able to send your child money despite living like this.

12:08.800 --> 12:09.690
No...

12:13.050 --> 12:14.950
That's a bad cough you have there.

12:15.680 --> 12:17.200
I'm fine.

12:17.220 --> 12:19.620
The west end of the market at four, right?

12:39.490 --> 12:43.640
You worked hard. I know it isn't much, but please take this.

12:45.290 --> 12:46.940
Thank you very much.

12:50.630 --> 12:54.280
I have to get this to Cosette right away!

13:10.070 --> 13:11.210
It's gone!

13:39.800 --> 13:42.030
You were robbed?

13:42.060 --> 13:47.580
Yes, a young man bumped into me at the flower market.

13:47.600 --> 13:49.290
That's when it disappeared.

13:49.690 --> 13:52.460
Please find that man.

13:53.070 --> 13:55.510
I need that money.

13:55.530 --> 13:57.690
I really need it!

13:57.700 --> 14:01.110
You've got guts to come begging to the police!

14:02.330 --> 14:04.850
I'm not! I was really robbed!

14:05.290 --> 14:08.810
If you persist, I will be forced to arrest you!

14:14.090 --> 14:15.480
Get lost!

14:38.990 --> 14:43.600
<i>To  Monsieur Chabouillet, Secretary of the Paris Prefect of Police,</i>

14:43.950 --> 14:48.270
<i>I am compelled to report some vital information regarding Mayor Madeleine.</i>

15:09.940 --> 15:11.330
Fantine!

15:15.530 --> 15:18.130
I can't stay here...

15:18.150 --> 15:19.550
This place...

15:22.570 --> 15:25.010
Fantine, are you all right?

15:26.080 --> 15:27.720
We've been worried about you.

15:27.750 --> 15:31.640
Where have you been? Has something happened, Fantine?

15:31.670 --> 15:32.310
Don't touch me!

15:33.580 --> 15:34.690
Fantine...

15:36.050 --> 15:40.690
To think that I was trying to save money looking like this.

15:40.720 --> 15:44.410
A stranger couldn't have known...

15:44.430 --> 15:47.120
Someone must have told him I would be there.

15:48.720 --> 15:53.120
That's right, you people told me about the job at the flower vendor.

15:53.520 --> 15:56.040
I was robbed after my shift!

15:56.070 --> 15:57.590
We had nothing to do with it!

15:58.230 --> 15:59.460
Then, who?!

15:59.740 --> 16:01.420
Who was that thief?!

16:01.990 --> 16:04.680
Give me back Cosette's money!

16:04.700 --> 16:06.510
If I don't send her money...

16:07.200 --> 16:08.390
Cosette will...

16:09.500 --> 16:10.720
Please!

16:11.750 --> 16:13.230
Give it back.

16:13.790 --> 16:15.310
Please...

16:25.930 --> 16:29.080
There's plenty of bread to go around. No need to rush.

16:30.390 --> 16:32.750
Yes, yes, the little ones first.

16:32.770 --> 16:33.660
Here.

16:33.690 --> 16:36.460
Thank you. One for my brother too, please.

16:38.320 --> 16:39.810
Here, take it.

16:40.440 --> 16:41.840
Thank you!

16:51.410 --> 16:53.270
Would you like a piece of bread, too?

16:54.920 --> 16:58.060
More than bread, I need money to send mail.

16:59.090 --> 17:01.610
I wish to write my daughter a letter.

17:02.380 --> 17:05.030
More than bread, I need money to send mail.

17:05.050 --> 17:06.240
Please!

17:09.970 --> 17:11.120
Are you all right?

17:13.480 --> 17:18.920
It's the mayor's fault that I've become this way.

17:21.280 --> 17:25.470
Mayor Madeleine fired me from my job at the factory.

17:25.490 --> 17:27.930
There must be some kind of misunderstanding!

17:27.950 --> 17:30.010
Mayor Madeleine is not that kind of person!

17:33.960 --> 17:37.810
I just wanted to send Cosette some money.

17:37.830 --> 17:40.980
But, the mayor fired me!

17:41.420 --> 17:42.730
It's him!

17:42.760 --> 17:44.500
Wait, Wait!

17:44.550 --> 17:45.940
Give me back my money!

17:45.970 --> 17:46.780
Hey!

17:51.850 --> 17:54.080
Fired from the glass factory?

17:54.100 --> 17:58.540
Yes, she claimed that you fired her from her job at the factory.

18:03.320 --> 18:07.060
<i>I dismissed a troublesome girl.</i>

18:09.240 --> 18:10.720
Prepare the carriage!

18:10.740 --> 18:11.510
Yes!

18:15.040 --> 18:20.480
She sends letter after letter, but no money!

18:20.920 --> 18:26.150
Perhaps that woman has abandoned her own daughter.

18:26.720 --> 18:30.990
I can't believe that a mother would abandon her own child!

18:31.010 --> 18:33.830
How cruel!

18:33.850 --> 18:36.450
Poor Cosette was abandoned.

18:36.480 --> 18:39.330
No! My mother would never do such a thing!

18:39.350 --> 18:41.750
No, there's no doubt about it.

18:41.770 --> 18:45.300
The fact that she stopped sending money, can only mean that you've...

18:45.320 --> 18:48.630
..you've been abandoned by your mother, Cosette.

18:48.650 --> 18:49.510
No!

18:49.530 --> 18:51.430
She would never do that!

18:51.450 --> 18:54.220
My mother will come for me!

18:54.240 --> 18:57.680
She's busy making arrangements, but she'll be coming for me soon!

18:57.710 --> 19:00.890
Quit being so cheeky!

19:00.920 --> 19:05.520
My mother is coming for me! I just know it!

19:05.550 --> 19:07.320
She promised!

19:16.220 --> 19:20.370
If you're sent away, I'm going with you.

19:22.480 --> 19:25.710
Let's go find your mom, Cosette.

19:27.400 --> 19:29.380
Thank you, Gavroche.

19:29.400 --> 19:32.720
But, my mother will come for me.

19:32.740 --> 19:35.680
Then, the both of us can go with her.

19:35.700 --> 19:36.570
Yeah...

19:37.370 --> 19:41.940
I'll be able to see my mother soon.

19:44.210 --> 19:45.480
Yes.

19:45.500 --> 19:50.320
I did dismiss a girl named Fantine.

19:51.010 --> 19:55.700
She lied in order to get hired.

19:55.720 --> 19:56.990
She lied?

19:59.270 --> 20:02.370
She had a secret child.

20:02.400 --> 20:07.380
She left that child in someone's care and would constantly send money.

20:08.400 --> 20:11.300
You didn't bother to hear her reason for lying, did you?

20:11.610 --> 20:16.390
She didn't get along with the other workers and would often get in fights.

20:18.200 --> 20:19.010
It's snowing!

20:37.050 --> 20:37.910
What the...?

20:42.020 --> 20:43.660
Just a little bit...

20:44.730 --> 20:46.640
Please give me some money...

20:47.050 --> 20:49.050
What? A beggar?

20:49.070 --> 20:51.520
I thought it was a ghost.

20:52.240 --> 20:57.010
Too bad, I don't have any money to spare for the likes of you.

20:57.030 --> 20:58.390
Now, get lost!

21:46.000 --> 21:48.190
She should be locked up in a cage!

21:54.420 --> 21:55.320
Take her away.

21:58.680 --> 21:59.740
Let me go!

22:13.510 --> 22:16.520
ma maman (my mother)

22:17.480 --> 22:20.690
I like you very much, Mother

22:17.480 --> 22:20.690
Daisukiyo nee okaasan

22:21.360 --> 22:24.730
I love you, Mother

22:21.360 --> 22:24.730
Aishiteru nee okaasan

22:25.360 --> 22:29.200
Your warm inviting scent

22:25.360 --> 22:29.200
Atataku ii nioi

22:29.200 --> 22:32.580
My precious mother

22:29.200 --> 22:32.580
Taisetsuna okaasan

22:33.370 --> 22:36.450
As long as you call out to me

22:33.370 --> 22:36.450
Yobikakeru sore dake de

22:37.410 --> 22:40.630
It brings me joy, Mother

22:37.410 --> 22:40.630
Ureshii no nee okaasan

22:41.330 --> 22:45.380
My only mother

22:41.330 --> 22:45.380
Kono sekai ni tatta hitori

22:45.380 --> 22:48.470
in this world

22:45.380 --> 22:48.470
Watashi no okaasan

22:49.800 --> 22:51.680
Hug me tightly

22:49.800 --> 22:51.680
Dakishimete gyutto

22:51.680 --> 22:53.640
Kiss me gently

22:51.680 --> 22:53.640
Kisu wo shitte sotto

22:53.640 --> 23:01.350
Always be by my side

22:53.640 --> 23:01.350
Itsudemo watashi no soba ni ite ne

23:01.850 --> 23:04.610
On the path lined with chestnut trees

23:01.850 --> 23:04.610
Maronie no michi

23:04.610 --> 23:09.570
we walk hand-in-hand

23:04.610 --> 23:09.570
Futari te wo tori aruku

23:09.570 --> 23:13.280
If we sing together,

23:09.570 --> 23:13.280
Isshoni utaeba

23:13.280 --> 23:17.450
we can have fun with just that.

23:13.280 --> 23:17.450
Tanoshii ne sore dake de

23:17.750 --> 23:21.670
Bathing in the sunlight filtering through the canopy

23:17.750 --> 23:21.670
Komorebi no naka yureru

23:21.670 --> 23:25.670
Your beautiful eyes

23:21.670 --> 23:25.670
Kirei na hitomi

23:25.670 --> 23:29.300
And that gentle smile

23:25.670 --> 23:29.300
Yawaraka na hohoemi de

23:29.300 --> 23:34.970
envelop me.

23:29.300 --> 23:34.970
Watashi wo tsutsumu no

23:39.680 --> 24:09.590
Preview

23:42.410 --> 23:44.720
What? How cruel!

23:44.740 --> 23:45.600
Poor Fantine!

23:45.990 --> 23:49.020
Just you wait, Thénardiers! I'll make you pay for this!

23:49.040 --> 23:50.850
Hey, we can't do that.

23:51.250 --> 23:52.440
Why not?

23:52.460 --> 23:55.120
Because the two of us only appear in the episode previews.

23:55.130 --> 23:56.610
I guess we can only watch.

23:57.170 --> 23:59.190
Then, what's going to happen in the next episode?

23:59.210 --> 24:01.400
Next time, Thénardier's Malice.

24:01.430 --> 24:05.130
Hey! You're going to do bad stuff again? Thénardier!!!

24:04.580 --> 24:09.590
Thénadier's Malice

24:05.140 --> 24:07.200
I'll get you!!!

24:07.220 --> 24:08.550
I told you, we can't.

24:24.600 --> 24:29.650
Look forward to the next Episode!
